quality_filter: PAINS catalog loaded; synthesizability metric = SA_Score (reject SA > 6.0) [SA_Score (MorganGenerator shim)].
usage: launch.py [-h] [--smoke] [--library-dir LIBRARY_DIR] [--n-init N_INIT]
                 [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE] [--n-iterations N_ITERATIONS]
                 [--mogp-iters MOGP_ITERS]
                 [--model {coregionalized,independent}] [--rank RANK]
                 [--output-dir OUTPUT_DIR]

Safe launcher for the multi-objective BO loop (injects the Apple-Silicon
threading guard, then runs loop.py).

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --smoke               Fast end-to-end smoke test (n_init=5, batch_size=2,
                        n_iterations=2). Without it the launcher runs the
                        locked-in Grand Campaign (n_init=40, batch_size=5,
                        n_iterations=50). Explicit --n-init / --batch-size /
                        --n-iterations override either profile.
  --library-dir LIBRARY_DIR
  --n-init N_INIT
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
  --n-iterations N_ITERATIONS
  --mogp-iters MOGP_ITERS
  --model {coregionalized,independent}
                        GP model over the docking objectives: coregionalized
                        (ICM, primary) or independent.
  --rank RANK           IndexKernel rank for the coregionalized model.
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
